  "body": "The `/sync` response spec doesn't mention `unread_notifications` as required, but the \"Receiving notifications\" section states:\r\n\r\n> Servers MUST include the number of unread notifications in a client's `/sync` stream\r\n\r\nWhich, afaiu, means that `unread_notifications` is required.",
